          <mxGeometry height="50" width="140" x="335" y="1472" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note_skill_match" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fillColor=#fff9c4;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;fontSize=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;LLM #1 — _MATCH_PROMPT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;You are a skill router.&lt;br&gt;Does the goal match a predefined skill (≥80%)?&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;User goal: {goal}&lt;br&gt;Available skills:&lt;br&gt;  - {name}: {description}&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Return: {&quot;match&quot;: &quot;skill_name&quot;} or {&quot;match&quot;: null}" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="310" x="1160" y="125" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note_plan" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fillColor=#fff9c4;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;fontSize=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;LLM #2 — _PLAN_PROMPT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;You are a task planner.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;needs_plan=true: multiple independent ops /&lt;br&gt;  sequential steps / &gt;5 tool calls&lt;br&gt;needs_plan=false: simple Q&amp;A / single-file /&lt;br&gt;  lookup task&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Goal: {goal}&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Return:&lt;br&gt;  {&quot;needs_plan&quot;: false, &quot;steps&quot;: []}&lt;br&gt;  {&quot;needs_plan&quot;: true, &quot;steps&quot;: [{&quot;desc&quot;: ..., &quot;depends_on&quot;: []}]}" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="195" width="310" x="1160" y="325" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note_main_sys" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fillColor=#fff9c4;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;fontSize=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;LLM #3+ — Agent.chat(goal)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;System&lt;/b&gt; (built once in __init__, reused each call):&lt;br&gt;  ① _system_prompt (base):&lt;br&gt;     &quot;You are an expert coding agent...&quot;&lt;br&gt;     Working directory: {cwd}&lt;br&gt;     Project type: Python / Node.js / Go / Rust&lt;br&gt;     Top-level structure: src/, tests/, ...&lt;br&gt;     Repo outline (≤500 chars):&lt;br&gt;       file.py: 5: def func(), 12: class Cls&lt;br&gt;     Git status / branch&lt;br&gt;  ② + longterm.system_addendum:&lt;br&gt;     ~/.agent/memory/*.md contents&lt;br&gt;  ③ + context.system_addendum:&lt;br&gt;     Compressed history summary (if triggered)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Messages: [{role: user, content: goal}, ...]&lt;br&gt;Tools: TOOL_SCHEMAS (read_file, bash, grep_files, ...)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="255" width="360" x="1160" y="540" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note_step_ctx" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fillColor=#fff9c4;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;fontSize=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;LLM #4+ — Step Agent (one per plan step)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;System:&lt;/b&gt; same _system_prompt as parent Agent&lt;br&gt;  (reused — no re-scan of rglob / git status)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;User&lt;/b&gt; (_build_context()):&lt;br&gt;  Overall goal: {plan.goal}&lt;br&gt;  Current step: {step.description}&lt;br&gt;  Shared workspace: {workspace_path}&lt;br&gt;    (read/write files to pass outputs between steps)&lt;br&gt;  Output files from prerequisite steps:&lt;br&gt;    - {plan.steps[i].outputs[0]}&lt;br&gt;    - ...&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Same ReAct loop as main agent:&lt;br&gt;  API call → tool_use? → execute → loop&lt;br&gt;  max 10 iterations · TOOL_SCHEMAS identical" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="255" width="360" x="1160" y="850" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note_replan" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;align=left;fontSize=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;LLM extra — _REPLAN_PROMPT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A step has failed. Decide how to adjust.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Overall goal: {goal}&lt;br&gt;Completed steps:&lt;br&gt;  [{index}] {desc}: {result[:100]}&lt;br&gt;Failed step:&lt;br&gt;  [{index}] {desc}: {error[:200]}&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Return:&lt;br&gt;  {&quot;action&quot;: &quot;skip&quot;}&lt;br&gt;  {&quot;action&quot;: &quot;retry&quot;, &quot;desc&quot;: &quot;new desc&quot;}&lt;br&gt;  {&quot;action&quot;: &quot;replace&quot;, &quot;steps&quot;: [...]}" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="310" x="1160" y="1162" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
